In '''[[2003–04 in Scottish football|season 2003–04]]''' [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] won a double of the [[Scottish Premier League]] championship and the [[Scottish Cup]]. They reached the quarter-finals of the [[Scottish League Cup]], and the UEFA Cup after competing in the group stage of the Champions League. They set a [[Scottish Premier League#SPL records|new record]] for the most goals scored in a season – 105 goals.

